{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet","content_id":"5f67cefb-7631-11e4-a3cb-005056011aef","description":"Find out about paying tax on the remittance basis if you’re a UK resident who has foreign income and gains but do not live in the UK.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9190913","isbn":"","title":"HS264 Remittance of pre-6 April 2025 foreign income and gains, and the temporary repatriation facility (TRF)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet/hs264-remittance-of-pre-6-april-2025-foreign-income-and-gains-and-the-temporary-repatriation-facility-trf"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9190795","isbn":"","title":"Remittance basis 2025 (HS264)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet/remittance-basis-2025-hs264"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9190796","isbn":"","title":"Remittance basis 2024 (HS264)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet/remittance-basis-2024-hs264"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9190797","isbn":"","title":"Remittance basis 2023 (HS264)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/remittance-basis-hs264-self-assessment-helpsheet/remittance-basis-2023-hs264"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The remittance basis is an alternative tax treatment that’s available to individuals who are resident but do not live permanen